{
  "schemaVersion": "2.0",
  "id": 16558,
  "name": "@probitas-test/reporter",
  "variant": "project",
  "kind": 1,
  "flags": {},
  "comment": {
    "summary": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Test result reporting and formatting for Probitas.\n\nThis package provides multiple reporter implementations for formatting and\ndisplaying test execution results. All reporters implement the "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "Reporter"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "\ninterface from "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`@probitas-test/runner`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " and can be passed to "
      },
      {
        "kind": "code",
        "text": "`ScenarioRunner.run()`"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": ".\n\n## Links\n\n- [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/probitas-test/probitas)\n- [@probitas-test/probitas](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/probitas) - Main package (recommended for most users)\n\n## Related Packages\n\n| Package | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| [@probitas-test/runner](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@probitas-test/runner) | Uses reporters for output |\n| [probitas](https://github.com/probitas-test/probitas) | CLI that uses these reporters |\n\n## Available Reporters\n\n- "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "ListReporter",
        "target": 16563
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " - Detailed hierarchical output showing scenario and step names\n- "
      },
      {
        "kind": "inline-tag",
        "tag": "@linkcode",
        "text": "JSONReporter",
        "target": 16600
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": " - JSON output for machine-readable results"
      }
    ],
    "blockTags": [
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Using ListReporter (default for CLI)",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { ListReporter } from \"@probitas-test/reporter\";\n\nconst reporter = new ListReporter();\nvoid reporter;\n\n// Output example when used with ScenarioRunner:\n// ● User Registration\n//   ✓ Create user (15ms)\n//   ✓ Verify email (23ms)\n// ● API Integration\n//   ✓ Authenticate (45ms)\n//   ✗ Fetch data (102ms)\n//     Error: Connection timeout\n```"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Using JSONReporter for programmatic analysis",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { JSONReporter } from \"@probitas-test/reporter\";\n\nconst reporter = new JSONReporter();\nvoid reporter;\n\n// Output: JSON object with full run details\n```"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "tag": "@example",
        "name": "Configuring reporter options",
        "content": [
          {
            "kind": "code",
            "text": "```ts\nimport { ListReporter } from \"@probitas-test/reporter\";\n\nconst reporter = new ListReporter({\n  output: Deno.stdout.writable,  // Write to stdout instead of stderr\n});\nvoid reporter;\n```"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
